18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e3","summary":"Yasova confesses that she helped a malevolent dragon spirit attack Ugin in hopes of ending the storms.","participants":["yasova-dragonclaw","ugin","nicol-bolas"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"I saw that the storms would cease if I helped a malevolent dragon spirit kill the great Ugin.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=I%20saw%20that%20the,kill%20the%20great%20Ugin.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=I%20saw%20that%20the,kill%20the%20great%20Ugin.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e4","summary":"Yasova explains that the sar-khan encased Ugin in a stone cocoon after she healed him, causing the tempests to return fourfold.","participants":["yasova-dragonclaw","sarkhan-vol","ugin","dragon-tempests"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":67,"quote":"He encased Ugin in a great stone cocoon inscribed with draconic runes.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=He%20encased%20Ugin%20in,inscribed%20with%20draconic%20runes.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=He%20encased%20Ugin%20in,inscribed%20with%20draconic%20runes.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e5","summary":"Reyhan blames Yasova for the deaths of thousands, but Shu Yun interposes under his truce, and the khans forgive her.","participants":["reyhan","yasova-dragonclaw","shu-yun","alesha"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":73,"quote":"Shu Yun interposed himself between Reyhan and Yasova.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Shu%20Yun%20interposed%20himself%20between%20Reyhan%20and%20Yasova.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Shu%20Yun%20interposed%20himself%20between%20Reyhan%20and%20Yasova.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e6","summary":"The khans disagree over whether to open the cocoon, kill Ugin, or kill the brood-lords; Shu Yun insists on balance and seeking Ugin.","participants":["shu-yun","reyhan","tasigur","alesha","ugin"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"minor","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":85,"quote":"The destruction of the dragons is no better than the destruction of the clans.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=The%