ance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":104,"quote":"Someone must have told them about our little summit,\" said Reyhan.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Someone%20must%20have%20told,little%20summit%2C%22%20said%20Reyhan.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Someone%20must%20have%20told,little%20summit%2C%22%20said%20Reyhan.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e9","summary":"Tasigur's guards attack, and Alesha's party kills them.","participants":["alesha","tasigur","reyhan","yasova-dragonclaw"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"minor","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":114,"quote":"Alesha and her bodyguards charged, and the room erupted in chaos.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Alesha%20and%20her%20bodyguards,room%20erupted%20in%20chaos.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Alesha%20and%20her%20bodyguards,room%20erupted%20in%20chaos.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e10","summary":"Shu Yun takes the Annals scrolls from Quan to hide them and leaps from the window onto Silumgar's dragon, killing it with his tattooed palm.","participants":["shu-yun","quan","silumgar","annals-of-the-sage-eye"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":129,"quote":"His dragon tattoo flashed with magical energy, and he slammed his palm into a very particular spot on the dragon's skull.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=His%20dragon%20tattoo%20flashed,on%20the%20dragon%27s%20skull.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=His%20dragon%20tattoo%20flashed,on%20the%20dragon%27s%20skull.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e11","summary":"Shu Yun hides the scroll case in a room beneath the stronghold and swallows the key.","participants":["shu-yun","annals-of-the-sage-eye"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"minor","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":134,"quote":"He shut the door, took the key, swallowed it with a shudder, and ran back to the courtyard.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=He%20shut%20the%20door%2C,back%20to%20the%20courtyard.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=He%20shut%20the%20door%2C,back%20to%20the%20courtyard.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e12","summary":"Shu Yun kneels before Ojutai and offers his life to spare the Jeskai; Ojutai freezes him to death.","participants":["shu-yun","ojutai","quan"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":143,"quote":"The khan of the Jeskai fell.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=The%20khan%20of%20the%20Jeskai%20fell.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=The%20khan%20of%20the%20Jeskai%20fell.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e13","summary":"Reyhan is killed by Silumgar while holding off dragons as Yasova and Alesha escape across the lake.","participants":["reyhan","silumgar","yasova-dragonclaw","alesha"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":145,"quote":"Reyhan was felled by Silumgar himself.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Reyhan%20was%20felled%20by%20Silumgar%20himself.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=Reyhan%20was%20felled%20by%20Silumgar%20himself.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e14","summary":"Ojutai declares through his aven translator that the Jeskai are no more, orders every ghostfire warrior killed, and commands Quan to erase the names of the clans.","participants":["ojutai","quan","jeskai"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":156,"quote":"As of this day, there are no more clans. There are no more khans.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=As%20of%20this%20day%2C,are%20no%20more%20khans.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=As%20of%20this%20day%2C,are%20no%20more%20khans.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"khanfall-2015-02-18-e15","summary":"Silumgar sleeps on Tasigur's throne while Shidiqi and zombies collar Tasigur and make him the dragon's trophy.","participants":["tasigur","silumgar","shidiqi"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"After all, Tasigur,\" she said, \"you are his finest trophy.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=After%20all%2C%20Tasigur%2C%22%20she,are%20his%20finest%20trophy.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Khanfall","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kelly Digges"],"date":"2015-02-18","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/khanfall-2015-02-18#:~:text=After%20all%2C%20Tasigur%2C%22%20she,are%20his%20finest%20trophy.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Khanfall\" by Kelly Digges. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 18 Feb 2015."}},{"id":"story-tarkir-block-2015-04-29-e10","summary":"Dragons assault Dirgur Stronghold, Tasigur betrays the khans, Shu Yun offers his life to Ojutai, and Reyhan dies helping Yasova and Alesha escape; the clans fall.","participants":["shu-yun","tasigur","ojutai","silumgar","reyhan","yasova-dragonclaw","alesha","quan"],"location":"dirgur-stronghold","importance":"major","page":"stories/story-tarkir-block-2015-04-29","order":68,"story_date":"2015-04-29","storyline":"Tarkir block","source":"wizards","paragraph":55,"quote":"Reyhan dies during the fighting to secure an escape for Yasova and Alesha","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/story-tarkir-block-2015-04-29#:~:text=Reyhan%20dies%20during%20the,for%20Yasova%20and%20Alesha","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Story of Tarkir Block","series":"Magic Story","authors":[],"date":"2015-04-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/story-tarkir-block-2015-04-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/story-tarkir-block-2015-04-29#:~:text=Reyhan%20dies%20during%20the,for%20Yasova%20and%20Alesha","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Story of Tarkir Block\". Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Apr 2015."}}],"relations":[],"pages_say":[{"page":"stories/khanfall-2015-02-18","order":59,"story_date":"2015-02-18","presence":"appears","source":"wizard